    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43417" root="لهو" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهِىَ عَنْهُ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَا عنه</span> (Msb, K,)
<i>He became diverted from it, so as to forget it.</i>
(S, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استأثر</span>: and see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَتْ إِلَى حَدِيثِهِ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهْوٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُهُوٌّ</span>, <i>She</i>
(a woman) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, cheered,</i> or <i>delighted,</i>
and <i>pleased, with his discourse.</i> (M, K.) And so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَوْتُ بِحَدِيثِهِ</span>. (T in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رنو</span>.)

